sub agents | List, configure, and test agent integrations
sub doctor | Check environment health (Python, packages, HF cache, networ
sub telemetry | Manage anonymous usage telemetry (opt-in)
sub share | Expose a local model behind a public URL via rapidmlx.com
sub launch | One-shot bootstrap: patch IDE/agent client config to use rap
